
build project - ctrl b

LSP - 
    preview symbol definition - K
    view errors - space sd
    

Restructuring - 
    rename symbol - space rn
    delete word - dw
    delete till end of line - D
    comment block - gcc gc



Formatting - 
    add semicolon to end of line(normal) - space ;
    add semicolon to end of line(insert) - ctrl e (terminals apparently dont support ctrl-*punctuation*)
    newline after cursor - enter
    newline before cursor - space enter
    format line/block - ==
    tab/detab line/block - <</>>

Navigation -
    Telescope -
        open telescope - ctrl p
        open selection in vsplit/hsplit/tab buffer = ctrl v/ctrl x/ctrl t
    return to previous spot - ctrl o
    jump x lines/characters - (number) h/j/k/l
    center cursor position on screen - zz
    jump to next word - w/W
    jump to end of word - e/E
    toggle header/source file - space th
    toggle h/s into new buffer - space tth
    highlight word under cursor - viw
    highlight all occurances of selection - *
    jump to next occurance - n
    jump to prev occurance - N
    un-highlight all - :noh
    search buffer - space sb
    search project - space sa
    search file - ctrl p

    search document symbols - space ss
    search all symbols - space sas

    seek to symbol def - ctrl ]
    open window to symbol def - ctrl w  ctrl ]
    seek func up - [
    seek func down - ]
    Tabs -
    next tab - gt
    prev tab - gT

Buffers - 
snap current left - ctrl-w H
snap current top - ctrl-w K
swap buffer pos - ctrl-w r

tmux - 
command key - `
move panes - command h/j/k/l
switch windows - command 0/1/2/3/etc..


